pageType: content
background:
  type: solid
  color: "$background"
elements:
  - elementId: deco-line
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [80, 58, 4, 36]
    shapeName: rect
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$primary"
  - elementId: page-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [96, 50, 1100, 48]
    content:
      style: "$heading"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>融资规划：A+B轮共8000万，投向技术研发与质控壁垒</p>
  - elementId: left-card
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [80, 120, 540, 280]
    shapeName: rect
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$card"
  - elementId: left-label
    elementType: text
    bounds: [110, 140, 100, 30]
    content:
      fontSize: 14
      color: "$primary"
      fontFamily: "Liter"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>A 轮</p>
  - elementId: left-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [110, 180, 480, 36]
    content:
      fontSize: 22
      color: "$text"
      fontFamily: "Liter, alimamashuheiti"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>2000万元 · 2027年 · 产品验证与标杆落地</p>
  - elementId: left-body
    elementType: text
    bounds: [110, 230, 480, 150]
    content:
      fontSize: 15
      color: "$secondary"
      fontFamily: "Liter, MiSans"
      lineHeight: 1.6
      align: [left, top]
      text: |
        <p>平台1.0系统上线、舰船/海工标杆客户实装验证</p>
        <p style="margin-top:6px">签约优质加盟节点 ≥ 50 家，服务终端客户 ≥ 10 家</p>
        <p style="margin-top:6px">全年营收突破 3500 万元，实现正向盈利</p>
        <p style="margin-top:6px">拟释放股权 10%-15%，优先对接产业资本</p>
  - elementId: right-card
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [640, 120, 560, 280]
    shapeName: rect
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$card"
  - elementId: right-label
    elementType: text
    bounds: [670, 140, 100, 30]
    content:
      fontSize: 14
      color: "$primary"
      fontFamily: "Liter"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>B 轮</p>
  - elementId: right-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [670, 180, 500, 36]
    content:
      fontSize: 22
      color: "$text"
      fontFamily: "Liter, alimamashuheiti"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>6000万元 · 2028年 · 全国规模扩张与生态建设</p>
  - elementId: right-body
    elementType: text
    bounds: [670, 230, 500, 150]
    content:
      fontSize: 15
      color: "$secondary"
      fontFamily: "Liter, MiSans"
      lineHeight: 1.6
      align: [left, top]
      text: |
        <p>全国加盟节点突破 100 家，覆盖多赛道终端客户 50 家以上</p>
        <p style="margin-top:6px">年度营收突破 8500 万元，净利润高速增长</p>
        <p style="margin-top:6px">拟释放股权 15%-20%，引入军工集团/工业互联网战略投资</p>
        <p style="margin-top:6px">具备跨高端装备领域复制扩张能力</p>
  - elementId: fund-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [80, 420, 300, 30]
