        - content:
            text: |
              <p>38%</p>
        - content:
            text: |
              <p>3040万元</p>
        - content:
            text: |
              <p>平台迭代、AI算法、数据库扩容、知识产权</p>
      - - content:
            text: |
              <p>市场拓展</p>
        - content:
            text: |
              <p>30%</p>
        - content:
            text: |
              <p>2400万元</p>
        - content:
            text: |
              <p>直销团队、招商渠道、区域运营中心建设</p>
      - - content:
            text: |
              <p>质控体系建设</p>
        - content:
            text: |
              <p>20%</p>
        - content:
            text: |
              <p>1600万元</p>
        - content:
            text: |
              <p>标准编制、质检中心布局、分级认证体系</p>
      - - content:
            text: |
              <p>运营储备</p>
        - content:
            text: |
              <p>12%</p>
        - content:
            text: |
              <p>960万元</p>
        - content:
            text: |
              <p>流动资金、长周期回款垫资、风险对冲</p>
  - elementId: exit-text
    elementType: text
    bounds: [80, 650, 1120, 30]
    content:
      fontSize: 14
      color: "$secondary"
      fontFamily: "Liter, MiSans"
      align: [left, middle]
      text: |
        <p>退出路径：科创板/北交所 IPO（5-7年） | 产业战略并购（3-5年） | 年度利润分红 | 原股东回购</p>
  - elementId: bottom-line
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [80, 680, 1120, 0]
    shapeName: straightConnector1
    border: {style: solid, width: 1, color: "$border"}
  - elementId: page-num
    elementType: text
    bounds: [1180, 690, 60, 20]
    content:
      style: "$caption"
      align: [right, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>17</p>
